{"n": 947, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "947.webp", "text": "3051852\n\n51-319/1\n\n5131 200 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nREAR WINDOW\n- Touring -\n\nThe same conditions are applicable to\nthe rear window as to the windshield —\nalso refer to M 3 window Installing in-\nstructions (5131 ...).\n\nCut through the cement bead on the\nrear spoller, as applicable, with a sharp\nflat knife or an electric tool* and knife*.\n\nLift off rear spoller.\n\nInstallation:\n\nReplace clips when reusing the spoiler.\nif applicable, remove the adhesive\nsheet uniformly.\n\nSource of Supply: HWB\n\n—> A <— 3051854\n\n30 51792\n\n30 51655\n\nBrush In window In area of the cement\nsurface with a primer’.\n\nNote:\nAlr drying time: at least 10 minutes.\n\nImportant!\n\nApply the primer only in the area of\n\nthe cement surface, since otherwise\nthe window glass would be Impaired\npermanently.\n\nCut off the closed nozzle tip In such a\nmanner to have a cross section open-\nIng A of 5 mm (0.197\").\n\nProduce sample beads before cement-\nIng.\n\nCheck for uniform feed and pulling\nspeed during application of the cement.\n\nNote:\nCheck the cement's date of expiry!\n\nProduce cement bead (1) In area of the\nadhesive sheet.\n\n* Source of Supply: HWB", "words": [["3051852", 0.1991, 0.7328, 0.2442, 0.7467], ["51-319/1", 0.4412, 0.0219, 0.5355, 0.0511], ["5131", 0.2695, 0.0749, 0.2964, 0.0862], ["200", 0.3014, 0.0749, 0.3202, 0.0862], ["REMOVING", 0.3278, 0.0736, 0.3875, 0.0862], ["AND", 0.3916, 0.0749, 0.4149, 0.0862], ["INSTALLING", 0.4184, 0.0743, 0.4848, 0.0862], ["REAR", 0.3278, 0.0908, 0.3587, 0.1028], ["WINDOW", 0.3622, 0.0908, 0.4108, 0.1028], ["-", 0.3273, 0.1134, 0.3333, 0.1167], ["Touring", 0.3374, 0.1074, 0.3779, 0.122], ["-", 0.3815, 0.1134, 0.3886, 0.1167], ["The", 0.2695, 0.1406, 0.2898, 0.1525], ["same", 0.2928, 0.1426, 0.3217, 0.1525], ["conditions", 0.3252, 0.1406, 0.3815, 0.1525], ["are", 0.3845, 0.1426, 0.4012, 0.1525], ["applicable", 0.4048, 0.1406, 0.459, 0.1552], ["to", 0.46